# The checkout line-ending law (windows-latest CI red, 2026-10-31):
# the index is 100% LF and every checkout must be byte-identical to
# it on every OS — a CRLF windows checkout broke source-grepping
# walls and the recipe parser (16 unit-red tests, PARAM-SEAT-PARITY
# + its census cascade). text=auto keeps git's binary detection;
# eol=lf pins the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
